description:
Dwr Cymru Cyfyngedig, trading as Dwr Cymru Welsh Water (DCC), is seeking to procure new, unused, UK specification commercial vehicles to support operational fleet requirements. The procurement covers a minimum of 140 vehicles and a maximum of 400 vehicles across four Lots:
Lot 1 - Ford Transit Custom L2H1 - 45 to 150 vehicles;
Lot 2 - Ford Transit Connect LWB - 45 to 150 vehicles;
Lot 3 - MAN TGE 6.160 4x2 SB Lion XC or equivalent 5.5t panel van - 20 to 50 vehicles; and
Lot 4 - Isuzu D-Max Utili
